{"job_id":"F-89a5772a6fb631b378a6","family_id":"F-89a5772a6fb631b378a6","title":"변호사보수의 소송비용 산입에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":21,"target_id":"4f6be98b9714ca119065e1c5c160c1101cf7c73c3f424e971c2fc965943b0511","source_hash":"4865610e5f4226e26a1a4f0b5ae589373a4d10a8254b11df7863324031d781f1","text":"关于将律师费计入诉讼费用的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":94,"target_id":"328770181ee434bea6a4368cdbf582f4e44dafcebb9a2032f5b6e6175dbcd4a3","source_hash":"4f138221065541d0a370a4b622dddb22310647238d56ae7c67e9c11ae7f71ae7","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是确定根据《民事诉讼法》第一百零九条第一款规定应计入诉讼费用的律师费数额。<1990年8月21日修订；2003年6月9日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":94,"end":210,"target_id":"d81538227c5e7d1a774e6ad349fd81a5e1c450d312024e2b1fc2feb2408a69f7","source_hash":"0b9818e74320fcc49870f634c6424653f5a1a9df1408f302c934369270cafd4f","text":"第二条（适用范围）本规则适用于依《民事诉讼法》规定可申请确定诉讼费用的案件（包括其他法律参照适用《民事诉讼法》规定的案件）。<1990年8月21日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":210,"end":604,"target_id":"3ed993f30903e80ed390aeef30b0a3c88aab44ef464e27dda1d4ea6f42b84ee1","source_hash":"e7639df672dde21b2d92fa238bdfb522f66437ce2d4a7ceae15206aa02728ffd","text":"第三条（薪酬纳入标准）\n① 诉讼费用中包含的律师费，应根据所附表格的标准，按诉讼标的物价值，逐级计算，并在当事人根据律师费协议已支付或应支付的律师费（以下简称“已支付律师费”）范围内计算。<2007年11月28日、2013年11月27日、2020年12月28日修订>\n② 在申请临时扣押令或禁令，或申请反对或撤销临时扣押令或禁令的案件中，诉讼费用中包含的律师费应为根据附表所列标准，按各级法院诉讼程序中受保护权利的价值计算的金额的一半，但不得超过已支付的律师费。但是，在申请临时扣押令或禁令的案件中，只有在举行过听证或审查的情况下，才适用此规定。<新增于1990年8月21日；2003年6月9日；2020年12月28日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":604,"end":775,"target_id":"c01e770d746fcfff33024d9f08710c68a1e636ca3781a3ecd7d6c4f9a128dc38","source_hash":"331fd69a52c67eaa4e3cb51ef5981885f7a3a0b295d5c11cebe31ef9639efe87","text":"第四条（诉讼标的价值等的计算标准）\n① 诉讼标的物价值或第三条所规定的受保护权利价值的计算，应当按照《民事诉讼印花税法》第二条的规定进行。<1990年8月21日修订，2003年6月9日修订>\n② 如果权利要求目的或申请目的发生变更，则以变更后的权利要求目的或申请目的为依据。<2020年12月28日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":775,"end":935,"target_id":"6cf69a22e19f6a5044f8f3028ec6367779bd59f856650b722e4df7f0fd9f8cfa","source_hash":"2c31f9dc946ddc6cfc65681fc7a02070d7c9aca742b5c55287201ea9204a4c47","text":"第五条（减少报酬） 被告完全承认或视为承认的判决、未进行口头辩论的判决、或者建议履行的判决，计入诉讼费用的律师费，应按附表所列标准，根据诉讼标的物价值计算的金额的一半，但不得超过已支付律师费的金额。<2003年6月9日修订，2020年12月28日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":935,"end":1170,"target_id":"9b005e5580c360eb2145a7e8ef1d35ffc0eec40426af21daca7bcec33912b550","source_hash":"8a7e2e23900140a13622d57da7437af089a07ad403b62d0ac495189139ac0ff7","text":"第六条（酌情调整）\n① 如果认为将第 3 条和第 5 条规定的全部金额计入诉讼费用有失公允，法院可以合理地减少该金额。\n② 如果法院认为根据诉讼的特点、聘请法律顾问的必要性以及当事人实际发生的律师费，第三条规定的金额明显偏低且不合理，则经当事人申请，可以将该金额增加至多一半。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1170,"end":1219,"target_id":"96d709a3eecfc57e94776bb1a5efa41392379c4a635894df7b216e0d784b9712","source_hash":"32d6041f119a5bc4a0d62dc8ad9c382bb42ae75cee0978a2a0d8f07cb8657df8","text":"补充条款 <第758号，1981年2月28日>\n\n本规则自1981年3月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1219,"end":1269,"target_id":"bd71942772b5eeeb207708c7cf63185d9947c214723afbc2371d7df48051425b","source_hash":"98ec9a952623d7629921774f6090ac8154cdc05a647a16817905b23f1ef678b2","text":"补充规定 <第1123号，1990年8月21日>\n\n本规则自1990年9月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1269,"end":1318,"target_id":"b169c082f1f78e1b28b736336b68f6b51591f862b164cec8b59947b44e61a44c","source_hash":"72b0208809d5a1c9eda4af4a486b5be2fab1ac28480b8a5974fa4b0bfa1a4a04","text":"补充规定 <2003年6月9日第1829号>\n\n本规则自2003年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1318,"end":1342,"target_id":"39bcb7c80d7b327483c17ef2cb1647bd13c06408843b49e94a1e11b6f6b0e080","source_hash":"f90139885f929fc35d57922c8a6737263d41f3ab63aeac0c5e5316f5adc973d0","text":"补充规定 <第2116号，2007年11月28日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1342,"end":1379,"target_id":"9955937a723b020b8315c93540c676a00e8681dcf57349d1e98c899d753e5d7a","source_hash":"c1a3e440142710ad0dee849bf693d46e733c6341d23bfed5119aef0734337638","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2008年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1379,"end":1510,"target_id":"8c0df5dc86233cb0eff7ab3902dab63325bb2e1bd12dde113f4b1bd5b7035fcc","source_hash":"2aa29af1a3747928004c320a6da901f2c37428545c10f2ecc36039cb2cc8fb1c","text":"第二条（过渡措施）本规则不适用于本规则生效前向法院提起的诉讼案件。但是，对于本规则生效后提起的上诉案件，在确定上诉法院诉讼费用中应包含的律师费数额时，应当适用本规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1510,"end":1534,"target_id":"440b1138d5ba08ff456429fb726816a02f112a1667f92f4901d0d78d03e429f9","source_hash":"29f1d775c8909c5e82a2f54e89b1a036657cc98589a6a0287c990035b7be7bf4","text":"补充规定 <第2496号，2013年11月27日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1534,"end":1571,"target_id":"f6cff89c53d4a3a651aeebf4a85dffbd58706fcddc3041a33dcecaf113938d64","source_hash":"19ff00e47c053030adac3b78072f1d22e685594eac18bfe2221a95846b78da68","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2013年12月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1571,"end":1701,"target_id":"fd15763bf897e78996d9e8cdff194352de998c0fbb61a628daee55b2a8c462fc","source_hash":"00fd1e122609e60cdda6877d55b5a3d7cead29dc4acaf68c1396463db34032b3","text":"第二条（过渡措施）本规则不适用于本规则生效前向法院提起的诉讼案件。但是，对于本规则生效后提起的上诉案件，在确定上诉法院诉讼费用中应包含的律师费数额时，应当适用本规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1701,"end":1723,"target_id":"f35bab8ca84089f1247807b8d145bfe3197ab5b56fb74370ba707cd9a2f5ad9c","source_hash":"8f8fa0c9609c543a81e8c9ccaa75cae7afa9609056587b27b101f4ef8c401a1d","text":"补充规定 <第2779号，2018年3月7日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1723,"end":1759,"target_id":"b664b71f51afe996cb331ca7629420a9b21642e66a86e8f3153613324e3d7ca5","source_hash":"de029671f8be628bafe0e796aad2d09af3d444f4f6853e6cda7693213f9f3b5b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2018年4月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1759,"end":1889,"target_id":"4e78371a6fafd9dce130df9c35a7751625ac14d90cc59c0b6300a190d8db984d","source_hash":"00fd1e122609e60cdda6877d55b5a3d7cead29dc4acaf68c1396463db34032b3","text":"第二条（过渡措施）本规则不适用于本规则生效前向法院提起的诉讼案件。但是，对于本规则生效后提起的上诉案件，在确定上诉法院诉讼费用中应包含的律师费数额时，应当适用本规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1889,"end":3473,"target_id":"2ae6e43f6be1baaa658c9ef67f0129f272026ecbbf4f51b5289dd848271bc500","source_hash":"2785e546b17409809210f2ea89fc4af74b0177de330ee79fc9327ec01424f830","text":"부칙 <제2936호,2020.12.28>\n\n이 규칙은 공포한 날부터 시행한다.\n\n소송목적 또는 피보전권리의 값\n■ 변호사보수의 소송비용 산입에 관한 규칙 [별표] <개정 2020. 12. 28.>\n\n┌──────────────────────┬─────────────┐\n\n│소송목적 또는 피보전권리의 값               │소송비용에 산입되는 비율  │\n\n│                                            │또는 산입액               │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│300만원까지 부분                            │30만원                    │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│300만원을 초과하여 2,000만원까지 부분       │10%                       │\n\n│ [30만원 + (소송목적의 값 - 300만원) x ]    │                          │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│2,000만원을 초과하여 5,000만원까지 부분     │8%                        │\n\n│ [200만원 + (소송목적의 값 - 2,000만원) x ] │                          │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│5,000만원을 초과하여 1억원까지 부분         │6%                        │\n\n│ [440만원 + (소송목적의 값 - 5,000만원) x ] │                          │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│1억원을 초과하여 1억5천만원까지 부분        │4%                        │\n\n│ [740만원 + (소송목적의 값 - 1억원) x ]     │                          │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│1억5천만원을 초과하여 2억원까지 부분        │2%                        │\n\n│ [940万韩元 + (诉讼标的物价值 - 1.5亿韩元) x ]│ │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│部分金额超过2亿韩元至5亿韩元│1%│\n\n│ [10,400,000 韩元 + (诉讼标的物价值 - 200,000,000,000 韩元) x ] │ │\n\n├──────────────────────┼─────────────┤\n\n│超过5亿韩元的部分│0.5%│\n\n│ [13,400,000 韩元 + (诉讼标的物价值 - 500,000,000 韩元) x ] │ │\n\n└──────────────────────┴─────────────┘"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00001","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302132","source_hash":"5f26b3ff9aa40457e117d4b7db641bf8608db7ee27a76d472b05656364164600","text":"■ 关于将律师费计入诉讼费用的规则 [附表] <2020年12月28日修订>"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00002","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302133","source_hash":"1f0475864ed163dc377c9618ce991d9d1068980d82234956c0b75103f349c887","text":"诉讼标的物或待保护权利的价值"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00003","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302134","source_hash":"21f28b7d4827fdc0b403490c73fa1f6255f1f47b991e1d5a2c4c853de27cc214","text":"诉讼费用中包含的比例"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00004","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302135","source_hash":"1509f0fec8a1db41b8e7579ee6e89eed14c8d8afacd1b4d0a9c3528598abc0b9","text":"或包含金额"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00005","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302136","source_hash":"aa8006d9dd916531af30691286a07b75af87c4ead2eefabf61b140af5a007ce2","text":"最高可达 300 万韩元 部分"},{"id":"A31255-zh-00006","doc":"A31255","law_id":"kr-005866-225413-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2302137","source_hash":"521ee2695a7d8d0c6f57a1ca6c5a3b